¦verses“„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ|Rejoice not against me, O mine enemy: when I fall, I shall arise; when I sit in darkness, the LORD shall be a light unto me.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse	¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙÌI will bear the indignation of the LORD, because I have sinned against him, until he plead my cause, and execute judgment for me: he will bring me forth to the light, and I shall behold his righteousness.¦layout ªlast_verse	„¥verse
